The '''Future Tech''' is the 11th and last [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]. It increases the player's [[Cat Energy]] limit. Like all Treasures, it is able to stack with others, specifically the [[Management Bible]], the [[Dark Matter]], and other Future Techs.

==Effect==
Each Future Tech increases Max [[Cat Energy]] by a maximum +30.

When a player has activated Future Tech at 100% in all three chapters, Max Cat Energy is increased by +90.

